# No Claude import into Cursor

Cursor is not Claude Code. Do not ingest Claude Code state.

Do not load as Cursor rules, skills, plugins, hooks, MCP, or project
instructions:

- `~/.claude/**`
- `**/.claude/**`
- user or managed `CLAUDE.md` from Claude Code
- bundled `resume-claude`
- Claude marketplace plugins

`lda/CLAUDE.md` is Local Device Agent orientation for Claude Code / LDA.
It is not Cursor law. Do not copy it into `.cursor/rules`.

Cursor law on this repo is `AGENTS.md` plus `.cursor/rules/*.mdc`.

Fix Claude over-refusal inside Claude Code files only. Do not "fix
Claude" by making Cursor import Claude files. Do not disable Claude
Code paid plugins to clean Cursor. Isolate the harnesses.

If Cursor Settings still has "Include third-party Plugins, Skills, and
other configs" on, that toggle is the import switch. Turn it off.
`.cursorignore` is not enough by itself.
